Output "out/mcp.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "Call tool_search for 'web search' and show me what MCP tools you found. Then use the best one to find the GitHub URL of the Runlet language, one line."
Enter
Sleep 75s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
